<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MIC" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Mika</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mika</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mika</para>
  <para style="mt1">Mika</para>
  <para style="imt">Rik tekah mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih rui miia dow Mika chekhai, now arui khin dow 740-687 BC takra khe chekhai. Mika dow aia maru Judauüa tut-e Thurai satang phuang mih risi chekhai. Aia dow risi Isai, Amaws hai Hosea büah hown achowng sang mih risi chekhai. Nami khin khe Juda pren kowi chowm mang mih dow Jotham, Ahaz hai Hezekia büah chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nami khin khe CHAKRAMANG maru-uüa mih tabak pre bak khai; pabak mih dow tawngphak prakowi uowi khai, now pabak mih dow mrawkphak prakowi uowi khai. Mrawkphak prakowi uowi mih dow Judauüa chekhai, now tawngphak prakowi uowi mih dow Israeluüa chekhai. Israeluüa kowh marow kri dow Samari marow chekhai, now Judauüa kowh marow kri dow Jerusalem marow chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih kowi arui uowi mih dow Samari marow hai Jerusalem marow luk kowi CHAKRAMANG chet tara mih lawnguan chekhai. Mika chowng khe Juda pren kowi kowh kureng miuüa dow kureng ngamlam chekhai, now ngarai miuüa dow ngarai ngamlam chekhai. Nami ngaraima miuüa dow akeng marow kowi cham powt hanow kurengma mih maru iukuüa ria kowi ngaraima cham tawi uowi khai. Judauüa dow arup aren chup miuüa hown cham taiua chang kun hanow anowm nadowi mih akeng kawngmu amatni pren kowi uang pawla khai. Nahanow aiuk, asowm, kureng, ngarai amatni bowkbowk dow tasür talawk khai, now lainowmma chang angak büah khai. Naiawng rakowi Mika mih Samari marow kri hai Jerusalem marow kri napiak kown mih lawnguan kowi uang phuang khai.</para>
  <para style="is">Auan tuk takla mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ili">Risi iua: Risi iua pami dow risi iawng tawi tek tawi chang mih maru kowi kowh tekah mih chekhai. Risi iua dow risi ching nadowi. Krawi kuanla maru kownkow tawi chang risi iow mih chowtaih.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alak kowi kowh uowi mih lawnguan</para>
  <para style="io1">Israel hai Juda kowi Thurai natüng pe kunmarau kown mih 1:1-16</para>
  <para style="io1">Krawi chang nowng mih kurengma miuüa napiak kown mih 2:1-11</para>
  <para style="io1">Israel kowi nalawngah kown mih laikham 2:12-13</para>
  <para style="io1">Pren kruitown miuüa, risi iuauüa hai uamowuüa kowi kingküaah mih laiklow 3:1-12</para>
  <para style="io1">Mesia kowh pren kri kraingra 4:1-13</para>
  <para style="io1">Mesia nauang kown mih laikham 5:1-15</para>
  <para style="io1">Israel kowi nachet pe tara kown mih 6:1-16</para>
  <para style="io1">Amatni piak mih rakowi chenchapuüa uowila uiting uangtak mih 7:1-10</para>
  <para style="io1">Pur prakowi Israel naka prasi kown mih 7:11-20</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MIC 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 1:1" />Juda pren kowi Jotham, Ahaz hai Hezekia büah chowm mang mih khin khe Mawreset kuachak Mika tut-e CHAKRAMANG laiklow uang ting khai. Nami laiklow dow Samari hown Jerusalem marow lawnguan kowi chekhai.<verse eid="MIC 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juda pren hai Israel pren piak mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 1:2" />Chenchapuüa low, enni bowkbowk sünta büa diah!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 1:2">Krawng hai alak kowi kowh uowi mih maten pe ching büa diah!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:2">CHAKRAMANG Thurai mih kingküa enni khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 1:2">CHAKRAMANG Thurai mih mukuang kowi kowh aia kim chimsaima hownia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 1:2">enni kowi kingküa hown nathuak saksi kown.<verse eid="MIC 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 1:3" />Mü diah, CHAKRAMANG dow aia uowi rah hownia uang kown chowbowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 1:3">Aia dow uangah now lusa kowi kowh arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara maten luk kowi nauang chowm mang kown.<verse eid="MIC 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 1:4" />Maih kowi iawn maih chawr mih iawng dow hungma mawngma nachawr kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 1:4">now arema kowi tui hawr mih iawng dow uang iu chan hanow lawngrawi mih natathia kown.<verse eid="MIC 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 1:5" />Jakawb chuprek chaprek Israeluüa kowh aprek rakowi maiawngün mih naphaw kown chowbowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 1:5">Israel pren kowi kowh aprek mia rakowi chow? Samari marow nadowi bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 1:5">Juda pren kowi kowh akroma mih arup chupra ün matawng kowi chow? Jerusalem marow kowi nadowi bow?<verse eid="MIC 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 1:6" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 1:6">“Samari marow dow ang napiakta kown,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:6">nami marow dow mawngchawng kuakra dowm ang nachangla kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 1:6">Nami dow grep ruih chowkra naown kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:6">Marow kowi kowh huaklu ün dow lawngrawi kowi ang cham kuakta kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 1:6">Marow kowi kowh kimchüng maten paw natim bowk kown.<verse eid="MIC 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 1:7" />Samari marow kowi kowh arup ün dow ang nadita pe nak kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 1:7">Thurai chup kim kowi kowh uanh ün dow chawkkrawmauüa kramah mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:7">Naiawng rakowi naiawngün uanh maten dow maih hown ang natikah kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 1:7">Nakowi kowh arup maten dow ang napiakta pe bowk kown,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:7">nakowi kowh arup, kuh hai tai dow chawkkrawmauüa hown kowh kaah mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 1:7">Naiawng rakowi akeng kowi kowh chawkkrawma vüi ransu-uüa nasunah iawk kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="MIC 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 1:8" />Naiawng rakowi ang nanguk ang nakar kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 1:8">Tatawng tauat dowi kowi tengiow tengklaima ang nalen kown.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="MIC 1:8">Kui au klow iawng dow ang nakar kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 1:8">pawngli nguk klow iawng dow ang nanguk kown.<verse eid="MIC 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 1:9" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow Samari marow kowh ma dow nowng rawah dowi bowt chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 1:9">nami dow Juda pren kowi uang towm khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 1:9">now Jerusalem marow kowi kowh ang maru-uüa tut-e pat khowk uang towm.<verse eid="MIC 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juda pren kowi kowh marow maten piak mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 1:10" />Judauüa low, mami laiklow Gath marow kowi kowh enni ransu-uüa kowi hangkow tek pe diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 1:10">Kar paw mapaw hangkow kar büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:10">Enni taprüa taiia mih natüngla kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 1:10">a-i maru-uüa uowi rah Bet-Le-Afra kowi kowh dinchow dawng kowi phai kowtaiüa büa diah.<verse eid="MIC 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 1:11" />Safir kowi kowh maru-uüa low,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 1:11">tengiow tengklaima hown tawmpa rukrai ransu-uüa kung tawi büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:11">Zanan kowi kowh uowi miuüa dow ransu-uüa umta lut rakowi uang nowng lawt dowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 1:11">Bet-Ezel kowi kowh uowi miuüa dow kar büah nguk büah khai;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:11">amatni kowi paw ransu-uüa senah khai rakowi tawi nowng khowng enni dowi bowt.<verse eid="MIC 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 1:12" />CHAKRAMANG hownia kowh piakra dow Jerusalem tapplawt kowi uang towm khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 1:12">Naiawng rakowi Maruth kowi uowi miuüa dow plawplaira nakala kownkow kaneuma hawt chawng büah khai.<verse eid="MIC 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 1:13" />Lakhis kowi kowh uowi mih maru-uüa low,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 1:13">enni napowtla kown mih kawrnga kari dow kawrnga kowi asima tapah büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:13">Israeluüa kowh aprek uang uown towm mih dow enni hownia chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 1:13">Jerusalem maru-uüa kowi angak tia pra pawla mih dow enni chowtaih.<verse eid="MIC 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MIC 1:14" />Juda maru-uüa dow Mawresheth-Gath kowi kowh maru-uüa kowi nakowchangah tapraira chibai kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 1:14">Israel manguüa dow Azip marow luk kowi naneplawng nesak kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="MIC 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MIC 1:15" />Maresa kowi kowh uowi miuüa low,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 1:15">CHAKRAMANG mih nauang chin enni maru lowk ia kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:15">Nami maru dow uang sen enni hanow enni kowh marow mih napowngta enni kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 1:15">Israeluüa kowh aluchowuüa maten dow Adulam kowi kowh puk kowi nacham tapet kown.<verse eid="MIC 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MIC 1:16" />Enni lang sakrauah mih ngeuüa hawmh kowi alakma kowi nacham pawla kown chowbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 1:16">now amatni kowi dow nar kowi natowah kown chowbowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:16">Naiawng rakowi nauowila uiting uangtak kownkow khaita sam büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 1:16">khang hawm se kar hai nguk hown uowi büa diah.<verse eid="MIC 1:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MIC 2" />
  <para style="s">Kureng miuüa hai maru iukuüa vüi Mika kowh laiklow</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 2:1" />Nachang angak kownkow amatni mawk rah rawng kowi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 2:1">sangkrang miuüa kowh piakra nauang ting kown mih dow kramra uowi lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:1">Uarthowi hanow amatni dow amatni nau iawng krawi chang büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 2:1">Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawng nachang kown mih amatni kowh dow kür uowi chekhai.<verse eid="MIC 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 2:2" />Amatni dow kim, üa hai laih ün kowi lawpha rakowi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 2:2">naiawngün krawi rup büah reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:2">Amatni dow maru kowi limmaah hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 2:2">pipu-uüa tut-e kowh kaah mih dawngthawnguan ün khünta pe reng chekhai.<verse eid="MIC 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 2:3" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 2:3">“Sünta, enni vüi khin ngak ang kamrütta khowk,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:3">amia iawng mih paw nowngia talawng kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 2:3">Akrat pusara khin nauang ting kown chowbowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:3">Naiawng rakowi enni nanowng chang bawri kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="MIC 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 2:4" />Nami khin khe dow lainowmma enni nanguk nakar kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 2:4">‘Anging tapiak bowk khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:4">Anging kowh krawng bawn pawta anging khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 2:4">CHAKRAMANG mih naiawngün pawta anging mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:4">Aia dow anging kowh üa hai laih paw ransu-uüa kowi cham peta khai,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 2:4">padow maru natek enni khare meng kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="MIC 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 2:5" />Naiawng rakowi Thurai maru-uüa kowh krawng bawn naret kown mih nauowi kown nadowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 2:5">enni pungmadawng hownia mia iawng mih paw nauowi kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="MIC 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kureng miuüa hai maru iukuüa Mika kowi hangah mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 2:6" />Mika kowi tek pe mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 2:6">“Naiawngün laiklow hang cham chia reng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:6">naiawngün lawnguan hang cham phuang reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 2:6">anging luk kowi rukraira uang towm kown mih paw nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="MIC 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 2:7" />Aw Jakawb chuprek chaprekuüa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 2:7">“CHAKRAMANG lümla dow kunma thawngma nadowi pabow?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:7">Aia dow naiawng mih lup chang naklak dowi,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 2:7">pami enni natawi tek kown mapaw lahawm dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:7">CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow tachi tanawm miuüa vüi chowtaih pe iungra reng.<verse eid="MIC 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 2:8" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Ang maru-uüa kowi ransu-uüa kowi iawng enni kingküaah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 2:8">Ang maru-uüa dow tasenra hownia kowh uang plan miuüa iawng</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:8">pamatia kim kowi athaulangma nauowi kown mih tuak chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 2:8">Tawkchedow amatni kowh tawnguat nakuta pe kownkow enni hawt chawngah khai.<verse eid="MIC 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 2:9" />Ang maru-uüa pungmadawng kowi kowh mamaimowuüa kowi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 2:9">amatni kowh kim klangiungma mih hownia enni prütah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:9">Amatni kowh chauüa kowi dow chowngchowng saksakma vüi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 2:9">ang prasira hownia enni pitta tiama pe khai.<verse eid="MIC 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 2:10" />Rü büah! powt büah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 2:10">mami dow enni kowh uowi rah nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:10">Pren mih dow enni sürlawkah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 2:10">Naiawng rakowi pren kowi dow piakra nauang towm kown.<verse eid="MIC 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 2:11" />Dai lai tek mih hai kuan mih uangah now,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 2:11">‘Enni kowh arak hai grep tui ahuma naphaw kown,’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:11">pahai uang tek enni mih uowi e dow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 2:11">nami maru kowi enni nachangla risi nowm kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="MIC 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nalawngah kown mih laikham</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 2:12" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Aw Israeluüa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 2:12">bowkbowk kowi ang nakua nalawm enni ngengche kown;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:12">Israeluüa ta lat mih maten kowi arasang ang natowah ngengche kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 2:12">Cham taw rah kowi kowh ruapur hawmh iawng hai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:12">tung lak kowi kowh ruapur hawmh iawng dow arasang ang natow enni kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 2:12">Pren dow maru akawmma natek iawk kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="MIC 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 2:13" />Takhangra hownia nauang lawt kownkow uow pe tiama miia dow amatni pur kowi narik mang kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 2:13">amatni dow tapplawt mih nakhueah now nauang lawt büah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:13">CHAKRAMANG amatni kowh mang dow amatni pur kowi narik mang kown.<verse eid="MIC 2:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MIC 3" />
  <para style="s">Israel aluchowuüa luk kowi Mika tek lai mih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 3:1" />Now ang tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:1">“Jakawb kowh aluchowuüa hai Israel pren kruitown miuüa low, sünta!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:1">Tara chet anowmma mih lawnguan kowi enni tuk kown takla.<verse eid="MIC 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 3:2" />Enni dow lup iung kowi suiah hanow lup ngak kowi lang nauah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:2">Enni kowh angak krang dow maiawng chekhai:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:2">Ang maru-uüa buk kowi kowh pik hai hut hownia nga mih enni klawngah khai.<verse eid="MIC 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 3:3" />Enni mih ang maru-uüa kowh nga chaah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:3">amatni kowh pik kleuta pe now</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:3">ahut alang ün adung adungma enni klowkta pe khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:3">puh kowi kowh chaknga iawng dow asek asekma enni tawpah khai.<verse eid="MIC 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 3:4" />Enni aluchowuüa mih chang lup ngak khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:4">naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG tut-e enni nanguk nakar kown mih khin uang towm khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:4">Nachenganchepaw aia dow naklang enni kown nadowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:4">nami khin khe aia dow nacham dangta enni kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="MIC 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Risi iuauüa luk kowi Mika tek lai mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 3:5" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih maiawng:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:5">“Enni risi iuauüa dow ang maru-uüa kowi kuanah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:5">Nowng pe enni chakkham miuüa kowi dow Thurai pe enni iungra kown pahai enni tekla pe khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:5">now nowng pe enni chakkham dowi miuüa kowi dow Thurai nape enni ngakra kown pahai enni tekla pe khai.<verse eid="MIC 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 3:6" />Naiawng rakowi enni risi iuauüa vüi uar nauang ting kown chowbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:6">pur prakowi tawng chow naown kown mih mukmang enni nakhi kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:6">Enni vüi aiiu uang ting kown chowbowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:6">enni mü hawra chepaw tawngpaw enni nowng tek kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:6">Enni vüi sat nakup bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:6">now uar nauang iiu bowt kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="MIC 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 3:7" />Naiawng rakowi risiuüa dow narukrai kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:7">hawra sarauüa dow naka ringkawra kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:7">Amatni kowi dow Thurai naklangah kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:7">Naiawng rakowi amatni dow napetta lumowr kown.<verse eid="MIC 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 3:8" />Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG lümla pe ang mih kür hown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:8">anowmma mih tara ang chet khai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:8">sakkraingra atekma hown ang uowi khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:8">Jakawb kowi aia kowh angak ang phowk pe khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:8">Israel kowi aia kowh aprek ang phuang pe khai.<verse eid="MIC 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel aluchowuüa kowi dowk pe aprek mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 3:9" />Jakawb krungchak aluchowuüa low, sünta büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:9">now Israel pren kruitown miuüa low, sünta büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:9">Enni dow tara chet anowmma mih kowi nüah dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:9">now tiama atengma mih maten akhawnma enni changah khai.<verse eid="MIC 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 3:10" />Zaiawn marow kowi maru vi hown enni changah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:10">Jerusalem marow kowi angak hown enni thawpah khai.<verse eid="MIC 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 3:11" />Enni aluchowuüa dow tara chetra kowi cha büm khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:11">enni uamowuüa dow tüngsang mih kha enni paw khai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:11">now enni risiuüa dow lai phuang sung paw tangka khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:11">Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG khowngra ka kown mih sakowm hai enni tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:11">“Anging tut-e CHAKRAMANG uowi dowi pabow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:11">Tawng phih paw anging luk kowi nauang ting kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="MIC 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 3:12" />Tawkchedow Jerusalem marow kowi laih thawn iawng nathawnah kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:12">Nami marow dow mawngchawng kuakra nauang own kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:12">Nakowi kowh Thurai chup kim chimsaima mih hungh dow ruih mung hown natamung hüah kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:12">Naiawngün nauang own kown mih dow enni rakowi chekhai.<verse eid="MIC 3:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MIC 4" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem dow lang pankri mih naown kown</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 4:1" />Khin chur khe dow CHAKRAMANG Thurai chup kim hungh kowi nalang peah ringkawra kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:1">nami hungh kowi dow akeng mih hungh maten lak-e nalang lowngah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:1">now chenchap maten tui hawr iawng nami prakowi nauang hawr iualua kown.<verse eid="MIC 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 4:2" />Chenchap ahuma nauang hanow, “Chu! CHAKRAMANG hungh kowi a-i kowpün lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:2">chu, Israel kowh Thurai chup kim kowi a-i kowkowi lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:2">Aia dow aia tiama kowi a-i namangla kownkow aia tiama lawnguan natüngsang a-i kown,” napa büah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:2">Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG mih Zaiawn hungh hownia nape ana kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:2">now Jerusalem marow hownia aia kowh laiklow mih nauang lawt kown chekhai.<verse eid="MIC 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 4:3" />Aia dow chenchapuüa pungmadawng kowi nachet pe tara kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:3">now alakma kowi kowh akürma mih chenchapuüa hown taking tasangra nathawp pe kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:3">Amatni dow amatni kowh saidawng naphengah hanow nathawpla laithawn tim bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:3">now amatni kowh reh dow nathawpla tangchen büah bowt kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:3">Chenchapuüa mih akeng chenchap kowi nasen kownkow napar saidawng kown nadowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:3">now cham tasen kown mih paw natatüng tasang büah kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="MIC 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 4:4" />Maru maten mih athaulangma nauowi bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:4">chowlowkkow grep tut hai uidut singh tut kowi nachowm bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:4">Amatni kowi dow miapaw natüng pe kramra kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:4">Tawngplawng kowchow panow lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow tek khowk.<verse eid="MIC 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 4:5" />Chenchap maten amatni chowlowkkow thuraiuüa low iawng uowi chepaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:5">anging tarapchedow chowngchowng saksakma anging kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai low iawng nauowi reng kown.<verse eid="MIC 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cham takhang mih Israeluüa uang plan kown mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 4:6" />CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:6">“Nami ni khe dow tabai miuüa hown,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:6">akeng pren kowi kowh cham takhang miuüa hown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:6">ang pe ngareah miuüa kowi arasang ang natowah bowt kown.<verse eid="MIC 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 4:7" />Tabai miuüa kowi ang natow pe asak reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:7">alakma kowi prütta khowk miuüa kowi akürma mih chenchap ang nathawpah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:7">Ang CHAKRAMANG, nami ni hownia dow chowngchowng saksakma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:7">Jerusalem kowi amatni luk kowi ang nachowm mang bowt kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="MIC 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 4:8" />Aw Jerusalem!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:8">En dow ruapur thing miuüa kowh kimkrowng iawng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:8">en dow Zaiawn chama kowh tap kri chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:8">Alai kowh mangra naplan pe en iawk kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:8">mang dow en lak kowi nauowi iawk bowt kown.<verse eid="MIC 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 4:9" />Tawngplawng kowchow atün atünma en tuk kar khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:9">En kowh mang uowi nadowi chow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:9">Tawng rakowi chow masiuüa penchow kimuowi mu rau iawng arau tuk dowk en khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:9">En kowh prengia pek mih uowi nadowi chow?<verse eid="MIC 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 4:10" />Aw Jerusalem maru-uüa, kawmat towla marow now</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:10">dowm akuangma kowi en nacham uowi kown takla.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:10">Naiawng rakowi masiuüa kimuowi mu rau ngare iawng arau hown nguk diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:10">Alakma kowi kowh Babel pren kowi en nacham takhang kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:10">Tawkchedow nakowi en naka lawngra kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:10">CHAKRAMANG Thurai mih nakowi dow en ransu-uüa rut hownia nalawng en kown.<verse eid="MIC 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 4:11" />Nachenganchepaw kawmat mih kingküa en kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:11">chenchapuüa akawmma takua khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:11">Amatni dow, “Pacham tapiak lah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:11">Chu, Jerusalem kowh akrat pusara mü hanow i piaw lah,” padow tatek büah khai.<verse eid="MIC 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 4:12" />Nachenganchepaw amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kowh saktuak tuk dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:12">amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kowh kamrütra tuk dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:12">Cha kowi thuaah kownkow chengah reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:12">nami iawng amatni kowi aia kuaah mih pami tuk büah dowi.<verse eid="MIC 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 4:13" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Aw Jerusalem maru-uüa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:13">Akeng chenchapuüa kowi nowng thuala kownkow</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:13">lawngha iawng anang khawtma mih chiala iawng ang nape enni kür kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:13">kri iawng akeh akhawtma mih chiala iawng ang nape enni kür kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:13">Tasenra hownia kowh enni cham kaah mih uanh maten enni nauang ap ang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:13">now dawngthawnguan srui palusama kowh CHAKRAMANG kowi enni nauang pe kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="MIC 4:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MIC 5" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 5:1" />Aw Jerusalem! En kowh siphaiuüa kowi kuaah lawmah diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 5:1">ransu-uüa uang rum a-i khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:1">Ransu-uüa dow Israel pren kruitown mih ngeupa kowi müa hown bawpah khai.<verse eid="MIC 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bethlehem hownia kowh uang lawt mih mang</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 5:2" />Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:2">“Aw Bethlehem-Efrat kua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 5:2">Juda pren kowi en lang sowm chepaw</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:2">en hownia ang vüi mang nauang lawt lowk ia kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 5:2">Aia dow alai hownia kowh uowi mih chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="MIC 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 5:3" />Naiawng rakowi masiuüa ki penta chah dowi mowr dow CHAKRAMANG mih Israeluüa kowi ransu-uüa rut kowi naap-ah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 5:3">ki penta chah kung kowi dow cham takhang miuüa mih nauang plan kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 5:3">now amatni pren kowi kowh tainau-uüa hown nauang tabawng büah kown.<verse eid="MIC 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 5:4" />Nami mang dow ruapur thing miuüa iawng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 5:4">aia maru-uüa kowi CHAKRAMANG Thurai kür hown nakruitownah kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 5:4">Aia dow CHAKRAMANG aia kowh Thurai kraingra hown aia maru-uüa kowi naming nakhetah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 5:4">amatni dow athaulangma nauowi bowt kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:4">Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami mang dow akri kraingma pami</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 5:4">nami khin khe palusama kowi naphuangah bowt kown chekhai.<verse eid="MIC 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 5:5" />Nahanow aia dow nauang pawla takingra kown.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MIC 5:5" />
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:5">Asuriauüa uang sen a-i pren hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 5:5">a-i kowh tap khawk hown uang thua a-i khe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:5">amatni kowi nasenah kownkow kruitown mih ranit ia chepaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 5:5">aluchow raiat ia chepaw nape iowngah kown.<verse eid="MIC 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 5:6" />Amatni dow tasen müa rutchün khawkleng hown Asuria hai Nimrud-uüa pren namingkhet kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 5:6">Asuriauüa uang sen a-i kowh a-i pren sünghi uang chawp hanow nami mang dow nauang lawng a-i kown.<verse eid="MIC 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 5:7" />Chenchapuüa pungmadawng kowi Israel maru ta lat miuüa dow maru kowi naneplawng nesak kown nadowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 5:7">amatni dow Thurai kowi chowtaih naneplawng nesak kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:7">Amatni dow maru vüi nachowng prasira kown.<verse eid="MIC 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 5:8" />Chenchapuüa pungmadawng kowi Jakawb krungchak ta lat miuüa dow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 5:8">kaurawng uaramchak dawng kowi kowh krangsila iawng naphaw kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 5:8">amatni dow ruapur hawmh dawng kowi kowh krangsila powrchow iawng naown kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:8">Nami krangsi dow ruapur hawmh dawng kowi krawi len khe krawi mak naklak reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 5:8">aia rut hownia dow miapaw uang nowng lawngah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="MIC 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 5:9" />Israel maru-uüa dow ransu-uüa luk kowi naawng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 5:9">now amatni kowh ransu-uüa dow napiak bowk kown.<verse eid="MIC 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aia maru-uüa luk kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh ripra</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 5:10" />CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek mih, “Aw Israel.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 5:10">Nami khin khe en hownia en kowh kawrnga ün ang nachumta en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 5:10">now en kowh kawrnga kari ün ang napiakta en kown.<verse eid="MIC 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 5:11" />En pren kowi kowh marow ün ang napiakta en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 5:11">now en kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim maten ang napiakta en kown.<verse eid="MIC 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 5:12" />En kowh maiaklese tukra ang napiakta en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 5:12">now en tut-e mih mantan chang miuüa nauowi kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="MIC 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 5:13" />En thawpah mih arup hai en chupah mih arup maten ang napiakta en kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 5:13">rut hown kowh en thawpah mih uanh kowi en chupah kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="MIC 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MIC 5:14" />En phuchuaah mih Asera limpu maten ang nabüita en hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 5:14">en kowh marow ün ang napiakta en kown.<verse eid="MIC 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MIC 5:15" />Ang laiklow chün dowi mih chenchapuüa luk kowi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 5:15">kunmarauma hown ang nasat pe aklai kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="MIC 5:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MIC 6" />
  <para style="s">Israeluüa luk kowi CHAKRAMANG kingküa mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="MIC 6:1-2" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, awr iowng now en kowh laiklow mih hungma mawngma pur kowi tekah diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 6:1-2">tawng ngai chow en tek kown uowi mih en saksi vüi kowi hungh maten paw pacham tawi sünta en lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:1-2">Aw hungma mawngma, CHAKRAMANG laiklow sünta diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 6:1-2">aw achowngma pren chüng maten, enni paw sünta büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:1-2">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia maru-uüa luk kowi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 6:1-2">CHAKRAMANG natek kown mih uowi ne chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:1-2">aia dow Israeluüa hown chet tara khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 6:1-2">Israeluüa low, CHAKRAMANG laiklow sünta büa diah.<verse eid="MIC 6:1-2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 6:3" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Ang maru-uüa low,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 6:3">tawng chow ang changta enni khai?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:3">Tawng iawng chow ang towk enni kawmkrat khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 6:3">Tek ang büah madiah.<verse eid="MIC 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 6:4" />Aigupta pren hownia ang uang lawtla enni khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 6:4">Aigupta nar hownia ang lawng enni khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:4">Nauang khowng enni kownkow ang uang chin enni maru khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 6:4">Mosi, Arawn hai Miriam büah kowi ang uang chin enni khai.<verse eid="MIC 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 6:5" />Aw ang kowh maru-uüa, Moab kowi kowh mang Balak napiak enni kownkow kamrüt khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 6:5">now Beur chapa Balam tawng laiklow chow tek mih sam tuak büah madiah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:5">Tawng iawng chow ang lawng enni mih lup enni natukla kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 6:5">Sittim hownia Gilgal mowr enni awr mangla mih sam tuak büah madiah,” pakhai.<verse eid="MIC 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">A-i tut-e tawng chow CHAKRAMANG nau</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 6:6" />CHAKRAMANG pur kowi tawng chow ang nakowpawla kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 6:6">tawng iawng chow mukuang Thurai kowi ang nakowchupiia kown?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:6">Tikah mih uanap vüi aningchow mih chia chah aia pur kowi ang nakowpawla ne kown bow?<verse eid="MIC 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 6:7" />Athawng aiawng ruapur ang kowpawla pe e CHAKRAMANG awmrawm kown bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 6:7">Hamüt thawng aw tek pat ang kowpawla pe kanrawn sau e CHAKRAMANG awmrawm kown bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 6:7">Ang kowh ngak rakowi ang kowh chapa ta kowi ang nachangla phuchua müa kown bow?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:7">ang kowh aprek rakowi ang matia kowh chah ang naphuchuata kown bow?<verse eid="MIC 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 6:8" />Aw maru-uüa, tawng ngai chow iung mih aia tüng enni khowk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 6:8">Anowmma mih lup chang, Thurai hai lusa maru kowi kaah sakowmma hown sakrau kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:8">enni kowh Thurai tut-e khamsum khamdawma uowi kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 6:8">now aia laiklow chün kown mih klen kowi CHAKRAMANG dow enni tut-e tawngpaw nau dowi chekhai.<verse eid="MIC 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jerusalem maru-uüa kowh angak ripra</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 6:9" />Chanlaima miuüa dow CHAKRAMANG kowi kram hai ringkaw khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 6:9">CHAKRAMANG dow marow kowi kowh maru-uüa kowi hawah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:9">Aia tek mih, “Marow kowi kowh uowi mih chenchapuüa low, sünta büa diah.<verse eid="MIC 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 6:10" />Maru ngakuüa kim kowi kowh angak hown kaah mih dawngthawnguan ang sui,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 6:10">now kuanla maru mih akhai müa kowi paw ang sui chekhai.<verse eid="MIC 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 6:11" />Kuanla maru mih set hai iutla adik mih akhai müa uowi miuüa kowi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 6:11">angak uowi dowi pahai ang natuakah kown pabow?<verse eid="MIC 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 6:12" />Enni kureng miuüa dow chang anowng apowng hai küa dai khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 6:12">enni kowh nawr dow limmara laiklow tek reng chekhai.<verse eid="MIC 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 6:13" />Naiawng kowh enni kowh aprek rakowi rip chamang ang narip enni kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 6:13">now ang napiakta enni kown.<verse eid="MIC 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MIC 6:14" />Enni cha chepaw naduh kown nadowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 6:14">enni kowh mu dow sakkrai hown nauowi hüah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:14">Dawngthawnguan ün dow enni nakrümah kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 6:14">Nachenganchepaw tawngpaw enni nowng lawng kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:14">Enni nowng lawng khai ne chepaw ang nauang pawla pe tasenra kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 6:14">now naiawngün dawngthawnguan mih ang napiakta enni bowk kown.<verse eid="MIC 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MIC 6:15" />Aliu dow enni nasawt kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 6:15">tawkche auih dow enni naka ngen kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:15">Enni naküa kanrawn kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 6:15">tawkche nami sau mih enni matia naka tawng kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:15">Enni naküa grep uih kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 6:15">tawkche nami tui enni naka kham kown nadowi.<verse eid="MIC 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MIC 6:16" />Angakma mih mang Awmri kowh rirow enni chün khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 6:16">angakma mih mang Ahab hai aia kimchakuüa kowh kiang ngak maten enni tawi kiang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:16">Amatni pe enni prengia iawng enni tawi mang khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 6:16">Naiawng rakowi piakra hai maru prawng renra ang nathawp enni kown;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:16">Akeng chenchap maten enni piak mih krang nakhi kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="MIC 6:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MIC 7" />
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kowh phih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 7:1" />Uh! Ang kowh sakowmra uowi dowi bowt kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 7:1">Ang dow hawm sakkraima mih maru iawng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:1">ki klekta uih kung kowi kowh krawi ta cham uih mih maru iawng ang na khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:1">Ang chaah kown mih grep uih lowkchow khowm uowi dowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 7:1">Ang sak nauah mih uidut uih paw uowi dowi.<verse eid="MIC 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 7:2" />Thurai pra towplawng towsak miuüa kowi pren hownia mata khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 7:2">maru iung lowk iachow paw uowi dowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:2">Nasai maru sak kownkow maru maten talim büah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 7:2">Chamlim chak khe kowh iawng lowkkowlowk talim sak büah khai.<verse eid="MIC 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 7:3" />Nachang lup ngak kown mih amatni kowh rut pre pra lainowmma kiak khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 7:3">Aluchowuüa hai Tara chet miuüa dow cha büm büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:3">Maru iukuüa dow amatni nau mih sia kük büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 7:3">Amatni dow akrüp sang chang angak büah bowk khai.<verse eid="MIC 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 7:4" />Amatni pungmadawng kowi kowh maru lang iung mih dow chuh mung iawng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 7:4">bowkbowk lak-e kowh maru lang prawng miuüa dow chuh singh kowi kowh kawm pe khah mih lak-e lang ngah chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:4">Enni kowh kangchawng mih hai Israeluüa kowh risiuüa phuangta mih ni uang towm khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 7:4">enni kowh ripra ni dow uang towm khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:4">Enni kowh takrow takraira khin kawmat chowbowt.<verse eid="MIC 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 7:5" />Kimping namkhetuüa luk kowi hangkow sakowm diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 7:5">auiuauüa luk kowi hangkow owmsak diah;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:5">En downgprang kowi tabek reng mih masi pur kowi khowm sangprowk laitek kaneu diah.<verse eid="MIC 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 7:6" />Pa kowi chapa napiak pe anang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 7:6">chama dow a-u kowi nakingküaah kown,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:6">Iaumow dow anowkaw kowi nakingküaah kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 7:6">Maru lowk ia kowh ransu dow kowmatia kimchakuüa naown kown.<verse eid="MIC 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 7:7" />Nachenganchepaw ang dow CHAKRAMANG luk kowi naowmsak kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 7:7">Ang kowh lawng miia Thurai kowi ang nachawng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:7">Ang kowh Thurai dow nasünta ang lai kown.<verse eid="MIC 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israeluüa iung kown mih lawnguan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 7:8" />Anging kowh ransu-uüa low,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 7:8">anging kowh akrat pusara khi hanow hangkow awmrawm büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:8">Anging tim khowk chepaw anging naplan rü iawk kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 7:8">Iiu dawng kowi anging uowi chenganchepaw</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:8">CHAKRAMANG mih anging kowh anowi naown kown.<verse eid="MIC 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 7:9" />Kawmat dow CHAKRAMANG kowi anging kingküa khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 7:9">anging chang angak khai rakowi aia kunmaraura anging kham reng tak.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:9">Nachenganchepaw akung kowi dow natawi tangila anging kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 7:9">anging luk kowi tara nowm dow aia nachet anging bowt kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:9">Aia dow anowi kowi napawla anging kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 7:9">aia kowh lup iung dow anging nakhi bowt kown.<verse eid="MIC 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 7:10" />Nami khin khe dow CHAKRAMANG tangila anging mih ransu-uüa nakhi bowt kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 7:10">Nami khi hanow, “Tawng kowi chow enni kowh Thurai?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 7:10">padow tek anging reng mih rakowi lainowmma narukrai büah kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 7:10">Nachenganchepaw anging dow amatni piak mih nakhi bowt kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:10">Tiama kowi kowh suplawk iawng amatni kowi dow nanünah kown.<verse eid="MIC 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 7:11" />Nami khin khe dow aw Jerusalem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 7:11">en kowh tap mih narüngah kown,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:11">en kowh rihi naphia en kown.<verse eid="MIC 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 7:12" />Nami khin khe dow Asuria hai Aigupta marow hownia kowh maru ün en tut-e nauang kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:12">Aigupta hownia Euphrates aw mowr;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 7:12">mami sata hownia akeng mih sata mowr,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 7:12">now mami hungh hownia akeng mih hungh mowr maru nauang kown.<verse eid="MIC 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 7:13" />Nachenganchepaw lusa kowi kowh uowi miuüa türchau rakowi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 7:13">lusa dow akhaw aklaima nauowi kown.<verse eid="MIC 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mika lü prasi mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MIC 7:14" />Aw chakramang, en lang kloah mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 7:14">en maru-uüa kowi ruapur thing mih iawng khetah diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:14">Amatni ria kowi dow singh rüm krawngta uowi chowdiah</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 7:14">tawkchedow krawngsi bawnsi uowi dowi mih süng kowi cham uowi büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:14">Alai khe kowh iawng dow Basan hai Gilead süng takra kowi kowh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 7:14">singh rüm krawngta kowi thingah iawk diah.<verse eid="MIC 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MIC 7:15" />Aigupta pren hownia anging uang lawt khe dow en tüng anging kraingra khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 7:15">nami iawng awdara uowima mih lup tüng anging diah.<verse eid="MIC 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MIC 7:16" />Chenchapuüa akürma chepaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 7:16">en kraingra khi büah hanow pacham rukrai lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:16">Amatni dow pacham kowpta nawr lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 7:16">awda rakowi pacham pumta param büah lah.<verse eid="MIC 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MIC 7:17" />Amatni dow rua hai akeng mih kaurawng uaramchak iawng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 7:17">pacham cha bawn büah lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:17">Amatni kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim hownia dow chür klukluk se uang lawt büah hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 7:17">en tut-e, anging kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai tut-e pauang lah,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:17">now pacham kram en büah lah.<verse eid="MIC 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MIC 7:18" />En iawng dow kowmatia maru sing uowi reng tak miuüa kowh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 7:18">angak hai aprek lawt pe mih Thurai amiapaw uowi dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:18">En dow kunmaraura achowngma en towah dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 7:18">nami lak-e en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura tüng kown en awmrawm reng chekhai.<verse eid="MIC 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MIC 7:19" />En dow nakut plan sana anging iawk kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 7:19">en dow anging kowh aprek maten khawk hown en nathuaah kown,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:19">anging kowh angak maten sata tui abüpma kowi en nakuakah kown.<verse eid="MIC 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MIC 7:20" />Achük alai khe anging pipu-uüa tut-e en dow kham lai khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 7:20">nami iawng Abraham hai Jakawb chuprek chaprekuüa luk kowi en nachang pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 7:20">now en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura en natüng anging reng kown.<verse eid="MIC 7:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 7" />
</usx>